    "MOD-025's proposal). Generated by danger.orespawn.tools.hitbox.BossPartProfileWriter from godzilla.geo.json at the 1.7.10",
    "render scale 2.0 (orig ClientProxyOreSpawn.java:462), rest pose, body yaw 0; boxes fitted to the drawn cubes of",
    "the bones each part covers, pivots taken back through MHLib's pivot rotation. 16 parts: head (with jaws), neck,",
    "three body segments (the shoulders with the top), upper and lower arm with the hand per side, thigh and lower leg",
    "with the toes per side, three tail segments. The dorsal plates are left out (decoration; they would lift the body",
    "boxes above the crown). Damage: head 1.0, body/limbs 0.5, tail 0.25. main-hitbox keeps the 1.7.10 9.9x25",
    "envelope (orig Godzilla.java:72), not pickable and taking no damage: every hit goes through a part. PlayNicely:",
    "Godzilla.mhlibGetEntitySizeScale = 0.25 (render scale/4, box 2.475x6.25, orig :74). Replaces the hand-placed",
    "OreSpawnPartEntity layout (BOSS-007) and the GodzillaHead sidecar box (BOSS-014)."
